WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to Cyralune. This is your original player test.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Try pausing the video and skipping backward ten seconds.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Turn captions off and on with the CC button.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Adjust the volume and enter fullscreen.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500
The demo is complete. Your player is ready for a licensed episode.
